# {{.EventName}}

CTF event repository, managed with [MTCF](https://github.com/MicroClub-USTHB/mctf-cli).

## Quick start

```sh
mtcf validate            # check the spec
mtcf generate            # rebuild derived files
mtcf generate --check    # CI mode (no writes)
```

## Adding a challenge

Copy `templates/challenge_name/` into `challenges/<category>/<your-slug>/`,
edit `challenge/challenge.yml`, then run `mtcf validate` and `mtcf generate`.

A scaffolding shortcut will land in a future release:

```sh
mtcf init challenge web/your-slug
```

## Layout

```
mtcf.config.yml          # event config
challenges/<cat>/<slug>/ # one folder per challenge
  challenge/             # author-edited source-of-truth
  solution/              # writeup + hints (private)
  assets/                # downloadable handouts
  other/                 # private author-only files
templates/               # local starter templates
```

See the [MTCF spec](https://github.com/MicroClub-USTHB/mctf-cli/tree/main/docs/spec)
for the full contract.
